I've actually got a bit of an update. It seems like we have a handful of 
followers already! As I understand it, there are a mess more people on 
Facebook and Twitter (as well as some of the lesser-known microblogging 
sites). Is anyone here particularly adept in using any of these services? I 
wanted to set up a cross-post system to forward everything from the LLG's 
g+ page to fb and twitter, but I can't really handle the management and 
responses on my own. My over-all goal is to take everything that goes on in 
Lojban central and broadcast it to the larger Lojban community, most of 
which doesn't sit on IRC/Google Groups and talk with the senior staff/BPFK.

Anybody game?

